WEBVTT

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.040
This just isn't working.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.280
I have to get going!

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.710
See you later!

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.090
Huh?

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:50.960
What's wrong?

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:52.780
Are you not feeling well?

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.110
No, that's not it...

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.820
<i>Huh? She smells good.</i>

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:00.080
<i>Is that flowers?</i>

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.910
Did you just meow?

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:06.540
You actually think I would meow?

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.040
Yeah, I guess you wouldn't.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.490
The ones meowing are these guys.

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:15.580
They're so cute!

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:18.800
I wonder if they were abandoned...

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.310
I'd love to take them in,

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:27.720
but my apartment doesn't allow pets.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.620
I can't, either.

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:31.320
I know!

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:33.070
I have a good idea.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:35.200
Leave it to me.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.570
Oh, yeah. I'm Akane Sakurai from Class 2-C.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.280
You're also a second-year, right?

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:44.560
Yeah, I'm Isuzu Shiranui, from Class A.

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:46.870
Feel free to remember the name.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:49.880
Sure! Nice to meet you, Shiranui-san.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:28.640
<b>Cats and a Rainy Night</b>

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.640
Th-They're so cute.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.100
They really are, meow.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.670
You sound like a cat now, Miyoshi-san.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:34.770
Oh?

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:37.910
Hey, everyone.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.240
Get back to your seats!

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.400
Class is about to start.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.280
Give the cats a break.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.500
What's going on here?

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.370
Are those...

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:48.450
They're kittens.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.830
I know that.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:54.480
I'm asking why you brought them to school.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.710
I wanted to see if there was 
anyone who'd take them...

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:01.400
And you think that justifies bringing cats to school?

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.820
I'm sorry...

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:05.760
Well, no helping it now.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:08.630
I'll keep them in the faculty room for today.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:10.640
I'll ask the teachers, too,

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:13.910
but you need be responsible and 
look for people who'll take them.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.440
Thank you!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.110
<b>Faculty Room</b>

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:27.960
These kittens might be easier

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.600
to care for than my students.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:33.870
So, how do you plan to find owners for them?

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:36.380
Sorry, but I can't take one.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.080
I want one, too, but...

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.250
And there are five of them...

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.760
Yeah, that's why...

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:47.680
<i>Hi! It's time for today's lunch broadcast.</i>

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:52.360
<i>I'm your announcer, Akane 
Sakurai from Class 2-C, as usual.</i>

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:55.140
<i>Our guests today are...</i>

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.600
Five kittens!

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.440
<i>Here they are!</i>

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.360
They're all so cute.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.050
We're currently looking for people

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:07.490
who'd be interested in taking these kittens in,

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.990
<i>whether it's just one or all five.</i>

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.810
<i>If there's anyone who'd like a kitten,</i>

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.750
<i>please come to the broadcast room.</i>

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.000
<i>Thank you, everyone!</i>

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.260
There are exactly five of you.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.920
Niigaki-san from Class A...

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.040
Yep!

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.740
And Sagara-san from Class B, right?

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:32.970
That's right!

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.170
Yukie-chan and Nao-chan.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.320
Kazuha-chan, too!

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:39.150
I figured I wouldn't mind taking care of one.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.600
I've always wanted a cat!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.980
Me, too.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:46.240
I dressed up as a cat once, for a shoot.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:51.110
I don't think that really counts 
as a reason to get a cat.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.620
What's wrong with it?

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:54.770
Yeah!

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:56.880
Thank you all for coming.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:58.990
Come and get them after school, okay?

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.170
Hold it!

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:02.020
Tsukishiro-sensei!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:04.880
Have you all gotten your parents' permission?

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.320
When you take a life into your home,

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:10.540
you become responsible for that life.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.550
You can't just get rid of it anytime.

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:16.300
You need to think carefully about
whether you're able to care for it,

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.940
and talk the decision over with your parents.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:23.570
I have a friend in a veterinary hospital 
who has agreed to care for them

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:27.470
until we find responsible owners for them.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:30.200
Sensei, thank you.

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:32.410
Okay, everyone,

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:35.500
could you all talk it over with your parents first?

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:38.080
If they agree to it, let me know.

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:39.890
Got it.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.210
I'll ask them.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.510
Yeah, we should ask first.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:43.090
Yeah.

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:44.420
Right.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.460
Thanks.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:59.410
So, Shiranui-san was worried about them...

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.990
Your parents said no?

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:16.410
No, but they put a condition on it.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.290
A condition?

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:19.640
They said I can have one if I score

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.040
higher than average in all subjects on my midterms.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.240
My parents said something similar.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.070
What?

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.920
Well, you know I work as a model...

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:36.510
So they say I'm already neglecting my studies.

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:40.640
And I'm busy with judo every day, too.

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:44.860
So, basically,

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.570
these two girls are so busy 
with their clubs and jobs

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:52.050
that they don't have time to study, 
so they always score lower than average.

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:55.760
So, if they want a cat, 
they have to raise their grades.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:08:01.290
Well... I guess I'll look for other people, then.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:03.600
I think that would be wise,

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:07.210
considering that Kumada-san and Miyoshi-san have

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:10.960
the worst, lowest, lousiest 
grades in the whole school.

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:10.410
<b>Worst</b>

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.950
<b>Lowest</b>

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:10.950
<b>Lousiest</b>

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:13.320
They're not that bad!

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.480
Yeah!

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.680
Mine aren't the absolute worst!

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:19.010
My parents said yes,

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.000
but I can only keep one.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.320
If Niigaki-san and Sagara-san both take two,

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:26.190
we shouldn't have a problem, but...

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:29.520
So, the class rep gets one...

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:32.640
Niigaki-san and Sagara-san get two...

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:34.700
That makes five.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.950
You had to count on your fingers to get that?

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.120
Actually, my parents said the same

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.250
about getting better scores on my midterms...

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.630
And if I did better, I could have one...

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:51.800
Why was everyone given the same condition?

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.720
It can't be helped.

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.780
Midterms are close, you know.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.970
How about asking everyone 
during your radio show again?

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.350
Yeah...

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:08.190
<b>Broadcast Room</b>

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.220
So I was thinking of asking everyone again.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.240
Akane-chan!

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.450
We want the cats, after all!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.840
We'll be responsible and take care of them!

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:20.910
Yeah, so...

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.870
We'll study hard for our midterms!

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:24.370
Okay.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:27.240
Why don't we all study for midterms together, then?

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:29.360
There are only three days left, though...

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:30.710
Leave this to me!

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.670
I'll coach you all hard.

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:37.300
Everyone meet in the library after school!

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:44.800
No one's coming...

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.940
What are they doing?

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.310
Lean in more!

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:55.400
I'll give you a little snip 
and make you look beautiful.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.330
Nao

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.330
Sorry! I had to fill in for my 
senpai in a magazine shoot.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.750
Did you get a hold of everyone?

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.760
Yeah, but...

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:15.520
Kazuha-chan was asked by a friend
to step in and train at their dojo,

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:18.860
Niigaki-san said that one of the 
older ladies in her neighborhood

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:20.810
needed her hair done for a class reunion,

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.600
Sagara-san said a shop that's had 
bad business lately asked her

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.640
to do some street performances
 to bring customers in...

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.550
And Nao-chan said her senpai 
at work caught a cold

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:30.720
and she has to do some modeling in her place.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:33.770
What happened to studying for tests?

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:36.970
But everyone's really nice, huh?

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:39.280
They want to help when someone's in trouble.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:42.640
Oh, well.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.050
I guess we'll start studying for midterms tomorrow.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:45.660
Yeah.

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:52.760
No one's coming again.

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:54.800
What is everyone doing?

00:10:56.860 --> 00:11:00.550
Kazuha-chan's helping to fix her friend's dojo.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:05.180
Nao-chan said her senpai still isn't feeling well...

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:08.330
Sagara-san said they begged her to do

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.190
a performance at a neighborhood festival.

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:13.270
Niigaki-san said a girl she knows is going to see

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.620
her grandparents for the first time in ages,

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:18.520
and she was asked to make her look nice...

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:22.190
I think I see why they all have bad grades.

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:25.080
There's only one day until midterms...

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:27.080
We'll just have to...

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.710
have an all-night study session!

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:31.660
An all...

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:32.440
...night...

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:33.190
...study...

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:34.630
...delicatessen?!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.960
Session!

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:42.470
Yukie-chan said we should all 
have a slumber party and study.

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:45.640
Oh, yeah... Since midterms are tomorrow.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.480
Sounds good, but where?

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:50.880
I was thinking at one of our houses...

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:53.070
Can anyone do it?

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:55.240
My place is pretty small...

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.730
Mine, too.

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:00.380
In that case, come to my house.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.270
Shiranui-san?

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.790
Girl Friend BETA.

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.830
What a huge house.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:19.290
You look like a doll!

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:22.250
You wear that well. It's great!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.430
It goes perfectly with your black hair.

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:28.310
Just come in already.

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:36.560
The garden is beautiful, too.

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:38.530
There are so many flowers!

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:41.600
We've been teaching flower 
arrangement here for generations.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:43.320
So that's why.

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:47.200
Use this room.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.050
Thank you, Shiranui-san!

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:54.660
Let's get started, then.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.790
Secret Midterm Plans

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:01.880
Okay, I put together all the material

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:04.470
that will most likely be on the midterms,

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.140
so we just have to remember everything in here.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:08.960
That's amazing, Yukie-chan.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:10.800
You're definitely our class rep.

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:11.690
Got it.

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:12.600
Let's do it.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.450
Yeah, let's do this!

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:15.770
Excuse me.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:21.090
Th-Thank you.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:23.000
You didn't have to do that for us.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:23.660
Thanks!

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:24.400
All right!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:29.230
It's not like I did it for you guys.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.940
What are those flowers for?

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:35.290
I'm changing out the flowers in the alcove.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.670
They're pretty.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.710
What kind of flower is that?

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:40.870
They're sasanquas.

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:42.170
They represent...

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:45.050
overcoming adversity.

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.780
That's perfect for us right now.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:49.290
Okay, let's...

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:51.760
These steamed buns are really good.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.210
This could be bad.

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:56.580
I have to keep my figure...

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:00.110
This isn't afternoon teatime!

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:02.870
Yatsuka-san, you should eat some, too.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:04.860
Here you go.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:05.420
Huh?

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:11.880
These are good.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:12.620
Aren't they?

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.160
Yeah...

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:20.040
Whoa, that was close. 
I almost got caught up in your pace.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:21.500
Okay, first—

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:22.920
I know!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.440
How about starting with introductions?

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:26.880
Good idea.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.470
We're not all in the same class, after all.

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:32.200
Okay, let's do this fast, then.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.570
Yukie Yatsuka.

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:35.470
I'm the class rep for Class C.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:36.880
Wow.

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:38.390
Hey there, Class Pres!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.680
Same class here.

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:41.720
Kazuha Kumada from Class C.

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:43.520
I'm on the judo team.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.690
That's pretty cool.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.760
Judo Japan!

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:49.290
I'm Nao Miyoshi from Class C.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.540
I'm not in any clubs,

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:53.040
but I do some modeling on the side.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.740
That's why she's got such a good figure.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.230
A perfect body!

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:59.670
You don't have to react like that 
to everything, you know.

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:02.460
I'm Hina Niigaki from Class A.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.840
I love styling hair.

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:07.170
Over here!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.240
Emi Sagara, from Class B!

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:12.260
I'm part of the street performing society!

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.770
Street performing?

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:14.740
What do you do?

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:17.170
Well... Things like juggling.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:22.800
Don't play with your food!

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.190
S-Sorry.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:29.070
What about you, Shiranui-san?

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.070
I'm Isuzu Shiranui.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:37.040
Um... You're in Class A with Niigaki-san, right?

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:40.470
Thanks for letting us use your house today.

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:41.820
I guess I'm last.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:43.410
I'm in charge of the broadcasts...

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:45.170
Akane Sakurai-san, right?

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:47.950
We're always listening to the lunch broadcast.

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:49.250
Thank you!

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:51.880
Well, ready to start studying?

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:56.140
Oh, Shiranui-san, would you like to study with us?

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.760
I'll get dinner ready.

00:15:58.760 --> 00:15:59.560
Huh?

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:00.820
Both my mother and my grandmother

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:03.060
have flower arrangement practice, so they'll be late.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:05.270
I have to prepare dinner today.

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.860
Chestnut rice for dinner, huh?

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.020
Feels like autumn already.

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:13.400
This takes so much work.

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:16.780
So that leaves the pumpkin stew, grilled fish,

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.620
and boiled tofu, right?

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:18.890
Yeah.

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.620
All right.

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:23.720
I'm good at cutting.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:24.670
Leave this to me.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.750
I thought hair was the only thing 
you were good at cutting.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.920
We still haven't studied at all.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.260
Let's focus after we finish eating!

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:38.300
Thanks for dinner!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.220
I'll help you.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:42.510
You need to study.

00:16:42.510 --> 00:16:45.350
If we all help, it'll be done in a flash.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.690
Yeah.

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:57.700
Well, it's 9:00...

00:16:58.060 --> 00:17:00.520
We won't be sleeping tonight.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:01.450
I know.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:02.970
I'm prepared for it.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:04.810
Even if it's bad for the skin...

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.180
An all-nighter, huh?

00:17:06.180 --> 00:17:08.240
Why don't we make a shopping run, then?

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:10.090
We'll get some drinks and snacks.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.110
That's a good idea.

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:13.210
We can't do anything on an empty stomach.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.380
Shopping?

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.800
You just ate.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:19.010
But if it gets much later, 
it'll be dangerous to go out.

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:20.620
All right.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:23.680
Let's get something to thank 
Shiranui-san for everything, too.

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:26.080
Yeah. Let's.

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:31.980
Get everything you want in five minutes.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.470
Got it!

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:34.030
Sure!

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:36.530
Mineral water...

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:38.990
I think I want some potato chips.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:42.910
Four minutes, everyone.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.810
<b>Takenoko no Hayashi
(Bamboo Shoot Shaped Chocolate)</b>

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:47.620
<b>Kinoko no Mori 
(Mushroom Shaped Chocolate)</b>

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.660
I like these!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.620
Not those!

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:47.620
<b>Takenoko no Hayashi
(Bamboo Shoot Shaped Chocolate)</b>

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.320
Himejima-san?

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:52.800
You're supposed to get the "Kinoko no Mori."

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.430
You mean because your first name is Kinoko?

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.730
Get a clue, girl.

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:00.750
Huh?

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:03.120
There we go.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.140
I can't eat all of this.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:12.150
You ended up taking 30 minutes!

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.340
Let's head back.

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.610
Ugh, it's cold.

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:31.550
It's raining so hard...

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:33.120
I'm completely soaked.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.090
I hope it'll let up soon.

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:39.090
<b>Bath</b>

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.120
Wait, this is...

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.680
<b>Women's Bath</b>

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.040
This feels great.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.600
We lucked out.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.980
This is my first time in a public bath.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.020
Hey, your first time! Congrats!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:52.890
I hope our clothes will dry before we get out.

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:55.980
We have them in a dryer, 
so I think it'll be fine.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:59.000
Himejima-san's watching them for us...

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.940
She said she doesn't like baths,

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:01.990
but I hope that's okay.

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:09.420
You don't want to change, Himejima-san?

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:11.870
I'm too lazy to change.

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:13.800
Why are you here, anyway?

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:16.380
Never mind. Just eat up.

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:22.890
All right, now we can finally start studying.

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:28.960
Wh-What?

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.170
A power outage?

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:34.610
That night, after the rain, 
when everyone was together...

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:37.490
Something slowly approached them.

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:38.570
What was it?

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:39.990
Stop it!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:42.050
For some reason, the tatami 
mats in the room were wet...

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:42.870
I'm scared, I'm scared...

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:46.520
They took a quick look, 
and in the middle of the room,

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:45.750
Who is it?

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:50.000
there was a female ghost with long hair...

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:57.560
Shiranui-san?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:59.760
I heard people screaming...

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:04.220
I was just telling a little ghost story.

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:05.610
You didn't have to!

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.560
Tell us the rest!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.400
That female ghost...

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:10.400
What about her?

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.930
Stop it!

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:14.120
You guys seem to be having fun.

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:16.530
It's not that I'm scared, but...

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:19.130
Oh, Shiranui-san, you changed.

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:21.080
That's really cute.

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:24.450
I get stomachaches easily,
so my mother makes me sleep in it...

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.390
A cat...

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:31.020
Let's study.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:31.540
Yeah.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.580
So we can save those cats.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.030
We've gotta work hard.

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:35.540
Yeah.

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:37.840
I'll help, too.

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:40.870
If you don't understand something, let me know.

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:43.600
Shiranui-san is at the top of Class A.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:45.300
Really? Cool!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:48.080
Okay, let's study until morning.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.450
All right, I'll be going, then.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.980
You're going home?!

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:27.440
They all look like cats.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.390
Shiranui-san.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:39.800
Are you going to use those 
flowers in an arrangement?

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:40.520
Yeah.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:44.280
Sorry for keeping you up so late.

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:46.930
We ended up putting you through a lot.

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:49.890
It was a lot of fun.

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:51.280
Really?!

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:53.720
I'm so glad!

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:06.670
It's great that you all improved your grades.

00:22:07.210 --> 00:22:10.630
We didn't make it to the average, though.

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:13.440
But I did a lot better than last time.

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:15.450
So cute.

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:17.100
You'll be living with me now.

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:21.370
It'd be nice if we can have a slumber 
party with the cats next time.

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:22.120
Yeah.

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:24.400
What are you all going to name them?

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:26.020
They already have names.

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:28.570
When I first found them.

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:30.070
Kikyou,

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:31.570
Azami,

00:22:32.270 --> 00:22:33.080
Erika,

00:22:33.650 --> 00:22:34.580
Nadeshiko,

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:36.080
and Dahlia.

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:24.770
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:10.980 --> 00:24:13.550
Student council vice president Risa Shinomiya here.

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:17.080
I work every day to help the council president.

00:24:17.080 --> 00:24:19.720
Risa-chan, you're working too hard.

00:24:19.720 --> 00:24:21.530
Have some tea.

00:24:21.270 --> 00:24:24.770
<b>Episode 5: Darjeeling with Everyone</b>

00:24:21.530 --> 00:24:24.040
Next time: Darjeeling with Everyone.
